WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
The timer is a reminder to check,

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:04.520
not proof the cake is done.

00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:09.760
Insert a thin skewer into the center and
pull it straight out.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:12.820
It should have no wet batter.

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:19.400
Use dry oven mitts and let the cake cool
before frosting.

